<title>USA: Milwaukee, Wis., $34.145 mln won by ABN AMRO.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee, Wis., $34.145 mln won by ABN AMRO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO said it won $34.145 million of Milwaukee, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series G, with a true interest cost of 4.93 percent.</p>
